  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>量规：四栏三档（详见学案）</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12 }}>概念运用：三个概念，用自己的话解释</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12, marginTop: 8 }}>现象解释：说清“哪里像”，也说清“哪里不像”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12, marginTop: 8 }}>说不通：引出原话，说清为什么不成立</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.9, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12, marginTop: 8 }}>语言：学术语体，有判断句</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#B4552D', marginTop: 16 }}>三栏达标才算及格；“说不通”空着，整份降一档。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
